への利益還元を経営上の重要な施策の一つとして位置づけ、事業基盤充実のため、業績動向および財政状況等を総合的に判断し、配当による株主の皆様への利益還元を継続的に行うことを基本方針としておりました。しかしながら、公開買付者によれば、本公開買付けにおける買付け等の価格は、2026年９月30日を基準日とした中間配当及び2027年３月31日を基準日とした期末配当が行われないことを前提として総合的に判断・決定されていることから、当社は、本日開催の取締役会において、2027年３月期の配当予想を修正し、同期の中間配当及び期末配当を行わないことを決議いたしました。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年5月13日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 50, "50.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 50, "50.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 45, "45.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 55, "55.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", 